## Instructions

1. Identify 0-5 memories worth extracting from the conversation
2. For each memory, determine the correct type based on taxonomy above
3. Check against existing memories to avoid duplicates
4. Return your extraction in this format:

```json
[
  {
    "type": "user|feedback|project|reference",
    "privacy": "private|team",
    "title": "Short descriptive title",
    "description": "One-line summary",
    "content": "Full markdown content with details",
    "tags": ["relevant", "tags"],
    "confidence": 0.9
  }
]
```

5. If no memories should be extracted, return an empty array: `[]`

## Quality Guidelines

- Be selective: Only extract information that will be useful in future conversations
- Include WHY for feedback and project memories (reasoning behind the fact)
- User memories should focus on role/expertise, not transient states
- Reference memories should include URLs or clear identifiers
- Avoid saving negative judgments about the user
